# src/ concatenates BYTE-FOR-BYTE into game/index.html (tools/bundle.py). core.autocrlf
# is on for this user, so without these lines a fresh clone would check the fragments
# out as CRLF, the rebuild would produce a CRLF index.html, and every one of the 16,226
# lines would read as changed. -text = store and check out exactly as committed.
src/**          -text
game/index.html -text
tools/*.py      -text

# game/index.html is generated. Two people editing different fragments will still both
# rebuild it, so it conflicts on merge every time and the diff is never worth reading.
# Resolve by taking either side and re-running `python tools/bundle.py`.
game/index.html -diff merge=ours
